e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HAcys8N34VEQ7kNvwGfGUND&_nc_oc=AdrhYHP50z17pnOooiWlKpMJtjfLf414ffRv_V7Nrz1L3mYrDnzsx6QQcxq7LtKSQBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCgkj4163CqpSwDygBiTpSNifbKRZiaqtpakePxfh41nw&oe=6A622E79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ft7oN54e3A0Q7kNvwHsIR8R&_nc_oc=AdoELPu-qSPRiCOUyFcBU9Ka1S2zW5qlPK4ZBZ_HhbnBfH-NzeartlRkefprMetlCpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBicY7CyStCdzDd9vgWFOV_f9_wLLENuKlaxg_c8Zqmw&oe=6A6205D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IiLok3_hLfIQ7kNvwE-Xial&_nc_oc=Adoq-dUmLh66KkVsxd9i4sgklGw4GyZ8CoEDlFXnC8cPR_H_2F9K-b2Al8tmzQxBcds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAQY0uF9H0_QAWmketWpit1lq9qT_-zkCS_HVG66QCmnQ&oe=6A62117B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QkdjFxbcIeEQ7kNvwE0HxSN&_nc_oc=Adoo5DB074jLa5KUOozzmYP_Lmn8d_LX2FBREpjVcll_ee0hzuxhVq4CT2TqmJ9J7Zo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBL9dpW9TVnOCnip77yiU31KL0liIHrNLjPllEEgrqKMg&oe=6A6212CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3QZ2BbjS6K4Q7kNvwGbcYL7&_nc_oc=AdpD3SsY8jtDhMON6faqPpLGYJjeEBEYYLf649rnMW3YoYPOqRw0p0dIRYgKmE-HM6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDXBJXIZkHvsW8_XooCove6KYEnUOvfke8kAtC4qoFDlg&oe=6A61FBFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se